	"h6StrongholdGoblin": {
		"name": {
			"singular": "Goblin",
			"plural": "Goblins"
		},
		"description": "Goblins are \"degenerate\" orcs; they are the failures of the experiments that created the orcs, with blood that comes from lesser demons (mainly Imps). Goblins are short (usually four to five feet tall), skinny and frail, but very quick and nimble. The average goblin is cunning, cowardly and stupid. Unless in large groups, they rarely attack openly, preferring ambushes and (crude) traps. In orc armies, goblins serve as servants, spies, skirmishers, ritual sacrifices for shamans, throwing weapons for Cyclopes, and even food when rations run short.",
