	"h6StrongholdHarpy": {
		"name": {
			"singular": "Kite Harpy",
			"plural": "Kite Harpies"
		},
		"description": "Half woman and half bird of prey, Kite Harpies were first used in the wizards' armies as scouts, messengers and skirmishers. They won their freedom in the great orc uprising. The orcs accepted them as allies and regard them as the favored children of the Sky Father. The Kite Harpies living on the island of Pao were made from various tropical birds of prey, which is why they have such colorful feathers. Kite Harpies are one of the many branches of the \"beastmen\", first born in 512 YSD, when the Seven Cities created them to replace the orcs as guards, servants and even \"playthings\". Of mixed human and raptor blood, Kite Harpies first served in the wizards' armies as spies, messengers and guerrillas. They won their freedom in the orc revolution. The orcs see them as allies and as the Sky Father's most beloved children. There are many kinds of Kite Harpies, with the blood of ravens, eagles or vultures. The Kite Harpies settled on Pao carry much blood of tropical raptors from the eastern jungles, which explains their colorful plumage.",
