			"singular": "Dreamwalker",
			"plural": "Dreamwalkers"
		},
		"description": "Orcs pray to Mother Earth and the Sky Father, but the Dreamwalkers speak with the voice of the tribe's ancestors. To become a Dreamwalker, a shaman must travel in dreams to the spirit world and meet the souls of his forefathers. On this journey of the mind, the Dreamwalker must face the demonic heritage within himself and defeat this source of Chaos from the inside. Countless Dreamwalkers have died in this trial. Those who survive are changed beyond recognition: the struggle with their own chaotic blood has twisted their bodies, but at the price of this deformity they gain a deeper understanding of blood magic and the realm of spirits.",
