	"h6StrongholdCentaur": {
		"name": {
			"singular": "Centaur",
			"plural": "Centaurs"
		},
		"description": "Like the harpies (Kite Harpies), centaurs are beastmen, created by the wizards of the Seven Cities in the year 512 YSD. Half man and half horse, they served in the armies as scouts and mounted archers. But their days of glory came to an end when the wizards replaced them with animated constructs. Golems, gargoyles, titans and other constructs of every kind were far easier to manage, cheaper to maintain and more obedient. The centaurs were given ever more menial work, until they were reduced to carrying messages and pulling carts. Stripped of their status, they were filled with rage, which led them to join the beastmen's uprising of their own accord and then scatter across Ashan in search of living space, dignity and freedom. They soon met the orc tribes and became their allies, for they shared common interests and temperament.",
