			"plural": "Jaguar Warriors"
		},
		"description": "Among the orcs of Pao, Jaguar Warriors are the finest berserkers. They are the tallest, strongest and most short-tempered of all orcs. To become a Jaguar Warrior, an orc warrior must first kill one of the island's fiercest predators, the sabre-toothed panther, with his bare hands. Needless to say, the mask of a Jaguar Warrior hides countless scars left by this life-or-death rite. In battle, they charge recklessly into the enemy ranks in a frenzy, tearing everything apart with their obsidian claws. Jaguar Warriors often serve as honor guards for the mightiest orc chieftains and shamans.",
